// The Swampy Menace — read off `.planning/planning_quests/The Swampy Menace.md`.
// The guard captain sends the player to Oolga, and Oolga runs them in circles
// until they lose patience with her, which is the point.
//
// A stub: the quest stands in the journal as something known of and never begun,
// and the `@@@` on its one stage is what is still owed. `npm run notes` lists it.

# info the-swampy-menace
version: 0.1.0
dependencies:
  core
  tulsa

# quest oolgas-errands
title: The Swampy Menace
log: The guard captain has been asking after me, and it is to do with whatever the sewers turned up.

stage sent-to-oolga:
  log: Oolga has me carrying and fetching and will not say what any of it is for. @@@ unwritten past this line: nothing begins this quest and nothing carries it. It wanted the crates in tulsa.swamp-mire found in the order the herbs are; they say it plainly instead.
  complete
